  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing for impact against tuberculosis - Gabon (01-Jan-2018-30-Jun-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gabon, Tuberculosis, Centre de Recherches M&#xe9;dicales de Lambar&#xe9;n&#xe9; (CERMEL)This program has the following goals: By 2018, contribute to reduce morbidity and mortality related to TB in the Gabonese population. The objectives of this program are: Improve the number of TB cases reported (new cases and relapses) from 5,608 in 2014 to 9,144 cases in 2018 in the general population  including vulnerable populations</narrative>
  </description>
